Package: MyTools
Title: Statistical and Clinical-Trial Utilities
Version: 0.5.0
Authors@R: person("Andrea", "Arfe", email = "andrea.arfe@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A collection of R utilities for statistical and clinical-trial
    methodology. The current release provides the 'twostage' module, which
    enumerates admissible two-stage single-arm clinical trial designs for a
    binary endpoint, with optional non-binding and Simon-design constraints.
